Import the C function abs taking an integer, returning an integer, from the header "stdlib.h".
Import the C function labs taking a long integer, returning a long integer, from the header "stdlib.h".
Import the C function llabs taking a long long integer, returning a long long integer, from the header "stdlib.h".
Import the C function strtol taking a pointer to character and a pointer to pointer to character and an integer, returning a long integer, from the header "stdlib.h".
Import the C function strtoul taking a pointer to character and a pointer to pointer to character and an integer, returning an unsigned long integer, from the header "stdlib.h".
Import the C function strtod taking a pointer to character and a pointer to pointer to character, returning a decimal, from the header "stdlib.h".
Say Call abs with 0 minus 5 done.
Say Call labs with 0 minus 70000 done.
Say Call llabs with 0 minus 5000000000 done.
Say Call strtol with "ff", null pointer, 16 done.
Say Call strtoul with "777", null pointer, 8 done.
